  "Question": "Let \\(AB\\) be a diameter of a circle and \\(C\\) be a point on \\(AB\\) with \\(2 \\cdot AC = BC.\\) Let \\(D\\) and \\(E\\) be points on the circle such that \\(DC \\perp AB\\) and \\(DE\\) is a second diameter. What is the ratio of the area of \\(\\triangle DCE\\) to the area of \\(\\triangle ABD?\\)\n\n[Figure 1](figures/2005_AMC_10A_Q23_question_fig1.svg)",
